<title>UK: London Tea Auction price indications.</title>
<headline>London Tea Auction price indications.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>At today's London landed Tea Auction of 11,521 packages of 53.50 kgs, including 5,600 offshore, price indications in pence a kilo compared to the last sale and the corresponding week last year.</p>
<p>    Best available  195   (153)</p>
<p>    Good		152   (145)</p>
<p>    Good Medium     140   (135)</p>
<p>    Medium	    133   (128)</p>
<p>    Low Medium	unq   (100)</p>
<p>The highest price paid was 195 pence for a Burundi PD.</p>
</text>
